      "text": "[9:12PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement from Anthony inward Maryland intersection enroute Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way inward and outward is good.\n\nVehicular movement within Ọba Akran Road, Kodesoh Road, Local Airport Road, Ọba Akinjobi Way, Ikeja GRA, and in and out of Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way is good.\n\nTraffic on Ọba Akran link bridge and Airport link bridge is good.\n\nOfficers on ground doing the needful.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
