      "text": "[9:23PM] #IyanaIpaja #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is moving swiftly from Alaagba to Iyana Ipaja roundabout, and movement is smooth on New Ipaja Road in both directions.\nOn Lagos-Abeokuta expressway, traffic is flowing quickly from Danco to Goye outward, while inward traffic towards Pleasure is easing up. \nAdditionally, the route from Mosalasi to Isheri roundabout via Egbeda is fast-moving with no reported delays. \nOverall, traffic conditions are favorable with no impediments.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
